# 4. List Allows Duplicate Values

Lists allow duplicate elements.

```python
numbers = [10, 20, 20, 30, 10]

print(numbers)
```

Output:

```text
[10, 20, 20, 30, 10]
```

### Real-World Example

A list of students attending different classes may contain the same student name more than once:

```python
